cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MomentEmu in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MomentEmu: a lightweight, interpretable polynomial emulator"
abstract: >-
  MomentEmu fits closed-form polynomial emulators by moment projection and
  exposes them with millisecond inference, symbolic export and JAX/PyTorch
  autodiff.
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-02-05
authors:
